皓首。詔徙越嶲，行至豫章，上敕豫章內史虞悰賜盡，勿傷其形骸。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0046"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"依傳內死亡動詞；紀年平行正文另存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0037","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"張敬兒","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian"},{"start":33,"end":36,"surface":"張敬兒","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0033","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張敬兒。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong"},{"start":46,"end":48,"surface":"敬兒","id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006:m0046","person_id":"stv_g27_gl2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張敬兒。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong:p006","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-chaozong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008","text":"　　上曲宴羣臣數人，各使效伎藝，褚淵彈琵琶，王僧虔彈琴，沈文季歌《子夜》，張敬兒舞，王敬則拍張。儉曰：「臣無所解，唯知誦書。」因跪上前誦相如《封禪書》。上笑曰：「此盛德之事，吾何以堪之。」後上使陸澄誦《孝經》，自「仲尼居」而起。儉曰：「澄所謂博而寡要，臣請誦之。」乃誦「《君子之事上》」章。上曰：「善！張子布更覺非奇也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0016","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"褚淵"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wangjian:p008:m0022","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段實名及敘述視點。","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王僧虔"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-023-wan